sequenceDiagram
  actor U as User
  participant C as Home Page
  participant A as Express API
  participant DB as MongoDB
  U->>C: Open Home (onboarded user)
  C->>C: detect user has preferences
  C->>A: GET /api/songs/for-you
  A->>DB: read preferred genres / moods / languages / tags
  A->>A: build tiered match query (AND of filters)
  A->>DB: find songs matching all filters
  DB-->>A: candidate songs
  alt Too few results
    A->>A: relax filters (drop tags, language, mood)
    A->>DB: re-query with relaxed filter
    DB-->>A: additional songs
  end
  A-->>C: 200 {songs, preferences}
  C-->>U: Render "Made for you" section
